{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42901","headline":"补茅鸱 三 · 丘光庭","name":"补茅鸱 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅鸱茅鸱，无搏鷅鶹。\n汝食汝饱，莫我爲休。\n愿弹去汝，来彼鳲鸠。\n来彼鳲鸠，食子其周。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}